---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    I am a PhD student in the Computational Neuroimaging Lab at Biobizkaia Health Research Institute. 
    I obtained my bachelor's degree in Biomedical Engineering in Mondragon Unibertsitatea in 2021, where
    I also got my master's degree in Biomedical Technologies, in 2023. After finalizing my master's,
    I worked developing new features for the spinal surgery robot Alaya at Cyber Surgery S.L, in Donostia.
    My research mainly focuses on aging and neurodegeneration, building new tools for standardizing age
    modeling methods. I am also very interested in lesion network mapping in acute lesions and neurodegeneration.
  </div>
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="PhD Student in Biomedical Research"
      subtitle="Started on September 2023 in Biobizkaia HRI, Barakaldo, Basque Country"
    >
      My main projects focus on the identification of lifestyle factors that contribute to healthy aging trajectories, the characterization of 
      dysconnectivity in preclinical dementia patients; and the development of AgeML:
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Google Summer of Code 2024 Student"
      subtitle="Summer of 2024"
    >
      Contributing to Diffusion Imaging in Python (DIPY), for project: Conditional Tractogram Generation Based on age and neurodegeneration using 
      autoencoder networks. The objective was to integrate synthetic tractogram generation capabilities into DIPY, allowing researchers in the dMRI 
      field to obtain benchmark data for tractometry and synthetic control or pathological subjects for other kinds of studies.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Artificial Intelligence Researcher"
      subtitle="From Oct 2022 to Sep 2023 at Cyber Surgery S.L, Donostia, Basque Country"
    >
      Part of the Applied Research Team, investigating generative image-to-image models for reducing radiation in spinal surgery patients and for 
      automatic surgery planning.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="PhD Student in Biomedical Research"
      subtitle="Started 2023, ongoing, at Biobizkaia HRI, Barakaldo, Basque Country."
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Master's Degree in Biomedical Technologies"
      subtitle="2017 to 2018 at Mondragon Unibertsitatea, Arrasate, Basque Country. Graduated with honors."
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Bachelor's Degree in Biomedical Engineering"
      subtitle="2017 to 2021 at Mondragon Unibertsitatea, Arrasate, Basque Country. Graduated with honors."
    />
    
  </div>

